# Local Claude Code settings (contain machine-specific paths)
.claude/

# Deployment notes with real domain, e-mail and public IP. Kept local on
# purpose: this repository is public.
MY-DEPLOYMENT.md

# Saved session transcripts. Same reason: they quote the deployment notes
