# Affinity Photo working documents. The flattened export (acme_dns/Acme-DNS.png)
# is tracked instead — it is what icon.png and logo.png are derived from, and it
# is a fraction of the size with no editor lock files to trip over.
*.afphoto
*.afphoto~lock~
